      "description": "How to make a new KIND of harness instance — choosing the prefix family, the keep-the-kind's-name default and the owner's right to decline it, which inherited files the new owner may repoint, and what a new GRAPH typology must declare. Read before naming a new instance, before adding a value to the graph-typology registry, and before building a visualiser. Carries the test that usually says \"this is not a new kind\".",
